---
description: Push finished UTMMSC work without asking
alwaysApply: true
---

When a feature or fix in this repo is finished, commit it and push to `origin` with `git push origin HEAD`. Do not ask first.

If the API or shared code the Worker bundles changed, deploy the Worker from `apps/api` after the push. Do not commit secrets, `.dev.vars`, or unrelated local edits. Do not change git config.
